Apple is working on a 12th-generation <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad/">iPad</a>, and plans to update the most affordable tablet in the &zwnj;iPad&zwnj; in 2027. It's not going to be a major update, but if you're planning a purchase, you might want to wait for the newest model.<br/>
