<br/>
Apple last updated the &zwnj;iPad&zwnj;'s design with the 10th-generation model, giving the device a more modern look to better match the designs of the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-pro/">iPad Pro</a> and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-air/">iPad Air</a> models.<br/>
<br/>
