<h2 id="a-series_processor">A-Series Processor</h2><br/>
Rumors suggest the low-cost &zwnj;iPad&zwnj; will use Apple's A18 or A19 chip, both of which are built on a 3-nanometer process to bring speed and efficiency improvements over the A16 chip that's in the current model.<br/>
<br/>
